From 249284591113d1103f2bc47ca1445e0a2b005390 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 18:28:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(chat): dual-select session model picker and mobile
 sidebar stacking

Replace the full provider/model list in the session model switcher with
provider + model NSelects (aligned with new-chat), show the current model
label next to the mobile input button, and use fixed stacking so the
session drawer covers the global hamburger icon.
